nishi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Takashima</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Kinoshita</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Horie</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Relationship between renal function and plasma brain natriuretic peptide in patients with heart failure</article-title><source>J Am Coll Cardiol</source><year>2006</year><volume>47</volume><fpage>582</fpage><lpage>586</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16458140</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Austin</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Bhalla</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Hernandez-Arce</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Isakson</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name><name><surname>Beede</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Clopton</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Maisel</surname><given-names>AS</given-names></name><name><surname>Fitzgerald</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Correlation and prognostic utility of B-type natriuretic peptide and its amino-terminal fragment in patients with chronic kidney disease</article-title><source>Am J Clin Pathol</source><year>2006</year><volume>126</volume><fpage>506</fpage><lpage>512</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16938661</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cataliotti</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Malatino</surname><given-names>LS</given-names></name><name><surname>Jougasaki</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Zoccali</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Castellino</surname><given-names>P<