ocrit; CK<sup>&#x02021;</sup>, creatine kinase; LDH<sup>&#x000a7;</sup>, lactate dehydrogenase; CRP<sup>&#x02016;</sup>, C-reactive protein; BNP<sup>&#x000b6;</sup>, brain natriuretic peptide</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p>Echocardiographic findings of patients.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjim-23-191-i003"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>LVMI<sup>1</sup>, left ventricular mass index; IVSd<sup>2</sup>, end diastolic interventricular septum thickness; LVDs<sup>3</sup>, end-systolic left ventricular diameter; LVDd<sup>4</sup>, end-diastolic left ventricular diameter; PWDd<sup>5</sup>, end-diastolic posterior wall thickness; LA<sup>6</sup>, left atrium; DT<sup>7</sup>, deceleration time; RWMA<sup>8</sup>, regional wall motion abnormality</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T4" position="float"><label>Table 4</label><caption><p>Multivariable analysis of risk factors for CHF</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjim-23-191-i004"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>DM<sup>&#x02021;</sup>, diabetes mellitus; LVMI<sup>&#x000a7;</sup>, left ventricular mass index; CCr<sup>&#x02016;</sup>, creatinine clearance; EF<sup>&#x000b6;</sup>, ejection fraction</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>